  "description": "Once a princess, Ethelyn died at the hands of the merciless Duke Ripherius. Now reborn as a maid in his household—and worse, as his secret lover—she finds herself the object of his twisted affection. But as she plots her escape, one question haunts her: what if her death was never what it seemed?\n\n(Source: Manta)",
